        <panes>
          <pane id='2' selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Text' />
            <encodings>
              <text column='[federated.1dw53dw0uebn5k19zy94k0me2b10].[sum:Calculation_498210752906858497:qk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text />
            </customized-tooltip>
            <customized-label>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#d61f26' fontsize='10'>Glossary:</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>1. The horizontal axis - </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Distance (KM) Value buckets (&gt;=n)</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>, &amp; the parameter </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Bucket Size</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>(Distance KM)</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'> (decimal value from 0.1 to 100): </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'><![CDATA[     For example, the bucket of 0 (n=0) means that the Delivery Distance of each order in this bucket is >= 0 and < 1 when the Bucket Size = 1, or the Delivery Distance of each order in this bucket is >= 0 and < 10 when the Bucket Size = 10.]]></run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>The Bucket Size can be changed to any decimal value between 0.1 and 100.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>2. The left vertical axis represents the O</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>rder Distribution %</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'> of total number of orders.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>3. The right vertical axis </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Average Contribution Margin (CM) Per Order</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'> = Commission + Delivery Fee + MOV Customer Fee + Service Fee - Delivery Costs (All Per Order).</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>4. When the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Currency</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'> parameter is selected as Local or Euro, the corresponding </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'>Currency Code</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='10'> applies dynamically to Chart 2 (the Average Contribution Margin (CM) Per Order on the right vertical axis, and Table 2 ( Average MOV).</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-label>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='cell'>
                <format attr='text-align' value='center' />
                <format attr='vertical-align' value='center' />
              </style-rule>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-labels-cull' value='true' />
                <format attr='mark-color' value='#d61f26' />
                <format attr='mark-labels-show' value='true' />
              </style-rule>
